   <text>
      <front/>
      <body>
         <div>
            <opener>
               <pb ed="TBOO" n="VIII.305"/>
               <persName key="herwart_von_hohenburg_hans_georg_1553">IOANNES GEORGIUS HERWARTUS AB HOHENBURG</persName> AD
                    <persName key="brahe_tycho_1546">TYCHONEM BRAHE</persName>.</opener>
            <p rend="noIndent">
               <pb ed="A" n="52v"/>PERVENERUNT ad manus meas, Vir nobilissime atque
                    Mathematicorum omnium facile princeps, libelli duo, quos vir doctissimus et in
                    Geometricis plane rarus et insignis, <persName key="viete_francois_1540">FRANCISCUS
                        VIETA</persName>, nuper in lucem prodire voluit. Hos cum non dubitem te
                    perlibenter visurum, neque forte aliunde absque difficultate exemplaria
                    adepturum, his iunctos ad te mitto.</p>
            <p rend="indent">Cogito his diebus, si modo negotia publica et politica, quibus
                    admodum distrahor, id permittunt, <placeName ref="Augsburg">Augustam</placeName> me conferre, atque ibi, si ulla
                    ratione fieri poterit, manuscripta opera posthuma <persName key="leovitius_cyprianus_1514">CYPRIANI LEOVITIJ</persName> indagare et
                    nancisci, ut ea quoque ad te transmittere possim.</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Atque hisce tibi fælicissima
                    quæque ex animo precor et opto.</salute>
               <dateline>Datæ <placeName ref="München">Monachij</placeName> die 26 Apr. A. 1600.</dateline>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
